31	// maxNexusResponse bounds what one Nexus reply may take in memory. The replies
32	// are small JSON documents (a repository and the names of its members); the
33	// figure follows the reasoning of the catalog page cap and is not measured.
34	const maxNexusResponse = 1 << 20
35	
36	// maxNexusErrorBody bounds how much of a 404 body is read to tell Nexus's own
37	// "Repository not found" from any other 404. An assumption: the measured body is
38	// about 50 bytes. A longer one is not trusted and the 404 stays a plain status.
39	const maxNexusErrorBody = 4 << 10
